.TH UTIME 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
utime \- changes file access and modification times in whole seconds; null selects the current time
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <utime.h>
.B int utime(const char* path, const struct utimbuf* times);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes file access and modification times in whole seconds; NULL selects the current time.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR utime (2)
